msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30617"
msgid "From which point of view the AI works out what a station is about and chooses its songs. Mixed: the music's intention and its qualities together, the tested default. Technical: how it is made (harmony, rhythm, form, musicianship), as a musician hears it. Emotional: the emotion the artist sets out to express, and how seriously it is meant. Cultural: where it comes from (scene, era, tradition). Functional: what it is for (a party, a drive, focus, falling asleep). Lyrical: what the words are about; for instrumental music, the story it suggests. Off: no AI judgement. A favourite station can have its own."
msgstr ""

